    "commit_body": "v15 assess diff vs v14 on 2y showed:\n  75+ WR -2.5pp, 80+ WR -5.8pp, 85+ WR -5.3pp\n  <25 WR -4.8pp, Cap -0.142\n\nThe direction-aware blend cap (0.60) was too aggressive \u2014 it shifted\nmoderate-bearish signals into <25, inflating bucket counts (+19%) with\nlower-quality peaks. Reverting to the prior multiplicative formula; the\nzero-pileup cosmetic issue is tolerable vs the signal-quality regression.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
